00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:16.520
So david Morrissey confirmed the
Governor is gone. He said he had to die

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:19.770
because he had just basically done the worst
thing you could possibly do. #1 he

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:20.630
killed Meghan

00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:24.070
and then #2 he killed Herschel. There's no
