00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:47.340
chance

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:50.450
and my Number 1 WTF Moment - The
Governor kills Herschel. So this was the

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:52.759
most dramatic death in the episode.
Herschel was kind of like

00:01:52.759 --> 00:01:56.680
everyone's dad at the Prison. He was
the moral compass for that group.

00:01:56.680 --> 00:01:59.259
So what's going to happen now that he's
gone? They're all kinda scattered to the wind.

00:01:59.259 --> 00:01:59.710
 

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:02.790
and everyone is losing their shit. On
Talking Dead Kirkman actually said that

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:06.009
Herschel was supposed to die in the
second season but because he worked so

00:02:06.009 --> 00:02:08.429
